  "description": "NVIDIA Canary-Qwen-2.5B English speech recognition: a NeMo SALM that feeds a 32-layer FastConformer encoder into a Qwen3-1.7B causal LM through audio-token injection, decoded greedily. Loads the transcribe.cpp GGUF layout (general.architecture = canary_qwen).",
